    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97255" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρογγῠλό-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be round</i>, Al. <i><span class="en">
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				7.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ττρογγυλόομαι</span></b> , <i>to
			be</i> or <i>become round, globular,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Placit.
				3.4.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθόλικες</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὴν ὄψιν</span>
			<i>to have the semblance of roundness</i>, opp. to being really
			round, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1121b
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
